          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਕਹਾਣੀ (kahāṇī) is inherited from Sanskrit kathānaka, \"a little tale\"; CDIAL lists Punjabi kahāṇī under it (CDIAL 2705)."
