              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਸੁਣਾਉਣਾ — suṇāuṇā — \"to tell a story; to recite\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਦਾਦੀ ਰਾਤ ਨੂੰ ਕਹਾਣੀ ਸੁਣਾਉਂਦੀ ਹੈ। dādī rāt nū̃ kahāṇī suṇāundī hai. Grandmother tells a story at night."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ਮੈਂ ਇੱਕ ਕਹਾਣੀ ਸੁਣਾਈ, maiṁ ikk kahāṇī suṇāī."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਸੁਣਾਉਣਾ (suṇāuṇā) is the causative partner of suṇnā, \"to hear\", which goes back to Sanskrit śṛṇoti, \"hears\"; CDIAL gives no Punjabi form, but lists Lahnda suṇāvaṇ, \"informs\", under it (CDIAL 12598)."
            }
          ]
